      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Kconfig if/endif apparently isn\u0027t a real pre-processor check.  The if \"label\" block apparently just adds a \u0027depends on \"label\"` to everything in the block.\n\nWe may want more control than the architecture level.  Howe about using ${SOC_FAMILY}?\n\nThis would require this folder organization:\n    zephyr/app/ec/chip/nuvoton_npcx/Kconfig*\n    zephyr/app/ec/chip/riscv-ite/Kconfig*",
